        "title": "State, facts, and execution"
      },
      "children": []
    },
    "b-map-prose": {
      "id": "b-map-prose",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "GameKeep owns domain identity and validates links from game events into Agent Kernel. The dashboard displays execution through the shared kernel viewer. Reading a trace explains what ran. Checking the accepted event and state tells you what the system retained."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
